<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39973" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quālum</span></b> , i, n.,
		and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quālus</span></b> ,
		i, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a wicker basket</i> or <i>hamper</i>, for various purposes; <i>a
			fruit-hamper</i>, <i>wool-basket</i>, <i>winestrainer</i>, etc. (cf. colum). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b>
			<i>Neutr.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quala satoria,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 11, 5</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quala,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 23, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mundissima,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					7, 3, 9</span></i>
			.— </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>Masc.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in qualos pertusos propagari,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 52, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spisso vimine qualos,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 2, 241</span></i>
			 Serv.; so <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 3, 12, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saligneus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					9, 15, 12</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">8, 3, 4</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vindemiatorii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					33, 7, 8</span></i>
			 pr.; <i><span class="en">Pall. 4, 10</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
